B.eDI=new A.dr("t14",B.df,"Five-song playlist","Make a shared playlist of five songs: three from you, two from them \u2014 then swap.","",B.DK)
B.eE4=new A.dr("t15",B.df,"An open door",'Ask: "Is there anything on your heart you haven\u2019t told me yet?" \u2014 and just listen.',"",B.a0D)
B.eEd=new A.dr("h1",B.n9,"Love feels safe","Healthy love feels safe. You can disagree, say no, see friends and family, and still be loved. Respect is not a reward \u2014 it\u2019s the floor.","",B.zw)
B.eDx=new A.dr("h2",B.n9,"Love doesn\u2019t control","Checking your phone, controlling who you see, threats, or making you afraid are not signs of love. They are warning signs, whatever the reason given.","",B.zw)
B.fdr=s(["space","calm"],t.s)
B.eDq=new A.dr("h3",B.n9,"Boundaries are care",'Boundaries aren\u2019t walls \u2014 they tell the person you love how to love you well. "I need a little time to think" is a healthy thing to say.',"",B.fdr)
B.eDD=new A.dr("h4",B.n9,"If you ever feel unsafe","Protecting your relationship never means staying where you are hurt or afraid. If you feel unsafe, reach out \u2014 in Tanzania you can call 116 (free, 24/7) or the police on 112.","",B.zw)
